{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/26/5815929/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Hello"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/26/5815929/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/26/5815929/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前ひなちまがまあやのホッペに急にチューしてきたの"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/26/5815929/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしたらそれをみてた"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちはるん\n『貴女チューするなんてーφ(゜゜)ノ゜』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひなちま\n『まあやはチュッチュしたくなるのー(^з^)-☆』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしたらちはるんも急にまあやのホッペにチューしてきたのっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/26/5815929/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(照)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『まあやを見ると幸せになる(*´∀｀*)』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って言ってくれたの"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/26/5815929/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ニヒヒッ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも暖かい\nコメント......ありがとうございます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごく！すごく！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/26/5815929/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うれし〜んだ〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/26/5815929/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆の暖かさが心の支になってます\nいつも皆がまあやの中心にいます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/26/5815929/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それってほんとに幸せなことだな\nって思うんだ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもコメント読むたび感じさせてもらってます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この気持ちはきっと\n今の私！乃木坂46でしかあじわえない経験だと思うんだ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなありがとー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/26/5815929/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大好きー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/26/5815929/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(握手会ではなかなか大好きとか言えないけどblogで......(照))"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それと前回皆から教えてもらった\nアドレナリン\nまあやのアドレナリンが出てる時はきっと...\n握手会や歌ったり、踊ったりしてる時、それとブログのコメントでドキドキする事もあるから...\nその時出てるかな〜照"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日は待ちに待った大好きな\nまあや族さん達に逢える〜\n個別握手会だから......\nドキドキ〜わ〜い！\n楽しみに待ってます〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寒くなってきたので、本当に風邪をひかないように、まあやも気をつけます!\n気を付けて来て下さいね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/26/5815929/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"待ってます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/26/5815929/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"長野も朝早くから寒い中来て下さってありがとうございました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/26/5815929/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメント読んでると体調崩されてる方もいて\n早くよくなりますようにパワーを送るよ〜届いて〜！！！\n女の子の声援もあったの〜!!\n嬉しい気持ち〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/26/5815929/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっ！\n洗剤も早速色々と試してみます！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/26/5815929/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/26/5815929/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わ〜い！楽しみ〜！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/26/5815929/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どんな香りかな〜ウキウキ〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/26/5815929/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"（絵文字）絵文字ですが...\n皆さんの意見を参考にして\n絵文字は使うけど、あまりハデすぎないようにします"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/26/5815929/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもたまにはすごいのがあるかも...笑笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、いつものメンバー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/26/5815929/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"レッスン前、アンダーメンバーで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"組体操やろう\nってなってやったものの........."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/26/5815929/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全然できない..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/26/5815929/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/26/5815929/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なにをしているか全くわからない......笑笑笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"相変わらずみんな仲良しで笑いがたえません"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/26/5815929/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"早く皆様に見てもらいたいから\nレッスン頑張ります〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/26/5815929/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木ここの感想ありがとうございます〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/26/5815929/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだ見てない方は是非見てください\n感想待ってま〜す"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/26/5815929/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだ言えないけど...頑張ったよ〜...汗汗"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ではでは今日も川後のひなちゃんとBIGvoicegirlのせいらりんがきてるので！\nまたね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/26/5815929/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/26/5815929/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/26/5815929/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問返し又しますので待ってて下さい〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/26/5815929/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"朝は牛乳飲む派ですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では明日の握手会の服考えなくちゃ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもなかなか決まらないのー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/26/5815929/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"喜んでもらえたら嬉しいな〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これない方も写メをとるので待ってて下さいね〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/26/5815929/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/26/5815929/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BYE"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/26/5815929/0003.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}